<title>UK: Taylor Woodrow sells new building.</title>
<headline>Taylor Woodrow sells new building.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British builder Taylor Woodrow Plc said on Monday that it had completed the sale of a new office development in Reigate, southern England, to BZW Property Investment Management for over six million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
